# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  PRIVATE FULL-BACKUP REPOSITORY
#  This repo intentionally commits EVERYTHING — including .env (your real keys)
#  and every companion app's source. It is a complete snapshot for backup.
#
#  ⚠  KEEP THIS REPOSITORY PRIVATE. It contains your Supabase service-role key.
#     If it is ever made public, rotate that key immediately in the Supabase
#     dashboard (Settings → API).
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# The ONLY things excluded are dependency folders. They are NOT source code:
#   • they rebuild exactly from package.json / lockfiles via `npm install`
#     (or `pnpm install` inside Nebula), in seconds;
#   • Nebula's node_modules is a pnpm symlink store that does NOT restore
#     correctly through git on Windows — it would check out as broken text
#     stubs, so committing it is worse than useless.
# Rebuild them on the new machine instead of backing them up.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
